
// dot of two scalars is their product: both constant folds, both runtime
// lowers to multiplication, and a mixed constant/runtime scalar dot lowers with
// the constant operand in place. Regression for the lineSegment(scalar cell)
// path (dot(ba, ba) with ba scalar).
konst = dot(2.0, 3.0);
runtime = dot(p.x, p.y);
mixed = dot(4.0, p.z);
return sphere(konst + runtime + mixed);
